# Demo clip media is fetched at deploy time via
# ../scripts/fetch-demo-clips.sh and NOT committed to the repository.
#
# The repo holds only the manifest (scripts/clips.json), the fetch
# script, and the attribution doc (docs/demo-attribution.md). That way:
#   - we never redistribute KEXP's bytes ourselves
#   - the license trail stays attached to the original uploader
#   - a clone-and-build always re-fetches from source, with the runtime
#     decision to honor the license made by whoever runs the script
*
!.gitignore
